{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"依据原固定证据整理v3技术块和独立文档，结论与科学复核状态不变","content_hash":"1d1832663cac83eb247931c22bdb1d38df60bfafcfb44267d5b5717895656670","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:00.547490Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-development-agent-default-skill-acceptance","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","数值稳定性","detail"],"kind":"detail","level":"L1","owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"block_id":"inputs","markdown":"## 设计与输入\n\n将输入缩短为三个数$[10^{16},1,-10^{16}]$，枚举全部6种排列。各排列的精确和均为1，无需随机抽样。比较逐项累加、Kahan、Neumaier与math.fsum，并查看补偿在每一步是否仍能保留低位信息。","requires_block_ids":[],"role":"inputs"},{"block_id":"kahan","markdown":"## Kahan：补偿已经产生，仍可能再次舍入\n\n本次Kahan实现使用以下递推，初值$s_0=c_0=0$：\n\n$$\ny_i=\\operatorname{fl}(x_i-c_{i-1}),\\qquad\nt_i=\\operatorname{fl}(s_{i-1}+y_i),\n$$\n$$\nc_i=\\operatorname{fl}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{fl}(t_i-s_{i-1})-y_i\\right),\\qquad s_i=t_i.\n$$\n\n$s_i$为当前和，$c_i$为下一步将减去的补偿值，$y_i$为修正后的输入；$\\operatorname{fl}$为本机浮点舍入，所有数值无量纲。排列$[10^{16},1,-10^{16}]$的实测状态如下。\n\n| 步 | $x_i$ | $c_{i-1}$ | 实际$y_i$ | $s_i$ | $c_i$ |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 1 | $10^{16}$ | 0 | $10^{16}$ | $10^{16}$ | 0 |\n| 2 | 1 | 0 | 1 | $10^{16}$ | −1 |\n| 3 | $-10^{16}$ | −1 | $-10^{16}$ | 0 | 0 |\n\n第二步记录到了−1，说明补偿确实发生。但第三步计算$-10^{16}-(-1)$时，又舍入为$-10^{16}$，补偿未能进入最终和。返回值为0，相对于精确和1的绝对误差为1。这个轨迹否定的是该输入上“有补偿便没有误差”的推断，不能解释成“Kahan没有进行补偿”。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"methods"},{"block_id":"neumaier","markdown":"## Neumaier：保留校正直到最终相加\n\n本次Neumaier实现同样以$s_0=c_0=0$开始，先计算$t_i=\\operatorname{fl}(s_{i-1}+x_i)$，再按两项的幅值选择本步校正量$\\delta_i$：\n\n$$\n\\delta_i=\\begin{cases}\n(s_{i-1}-t_i)+x_i,&|s_{i-1}|\\ge|x_i|,\\\\\n(x_i-t_i)+s_{i-1},&|s_{i-1}|<|x_i|,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad c_i=\\operatorname{fl}(c_{i-1}+\\delta_i),\\quad s_i=t_i.\n$$\n\n右侧加减按脚本的浮点操作顺序执行，最后返回$\\operatorname{fl}(s_n+c_n)$。对同一排列，三步的$(s_i,c_i)$依次为$(10^{16},0)$、$(10^{16},1)$、$(0,1)$，最终得到1。第二步若立即计算$s_i+c_i$，仍可能舍入为大数；该例的低位信息在最终抵消完成后才进入返回值。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"methods"},{"block_id":"results","markdown":"## 全部排列结果\n\n按独立方法章，绝对误差仍相对于实际binary64输入的精确有理数和，精确命中不使用容差。\n\n| 排列 | 逐项累加 | Kahan | Neumaier | math.fsum |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| $10^{16},1,-10^{16}$ | 0 | 0 | 1 | 1 |\n| $10^{16},-10^{16},1$ | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\n| $1,10^{16},-10^{16}$ | 0 | 0 | 1 | 1 |\n| $1,-10^{16},10^{16}$ | 0 | 0 | 1 | 1 |\n| $-10^{16},10^{16},1$ | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\n| $-10^{16},1,10^{16}$ | 0 | 0 | 1 | 1 |\n\n![六种排列下各方法的精确命中数和最大绝对误差](figure:0)\n\n逐项累加与Kahan各精确命中2/6，最大绝对误差均为1；Neumaier与math.fsum各命中6/6，最大误差0。结果解释了一个具体失败机理，也界定了证据范围：这里是三项输入的完整排列比较，尚不能据此判断更长序列或其他数值尺度下的表现。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"results"}],"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"6663c5e22a2c3154c13dae18754d7cc20b6d4c225d159ebc8081cbe27a0beb34","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-DETAIL-R02","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"b25cf5ba5c1d95cdd1b1edb9dd7b3f0c65999462d04a5e7860423fce1e1de9d1","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201228Z-A0980824DC18","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8efe2879a142667db6d174693fc5738228e9904902d7a2c884e720d75d014b05","target_id":"RUN-20260908T215458Z-04C7D84D40D8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"a48c045211280be1e1bb58524a8067598eea6d9d8e964a8b513b4b544e195cd6","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-INPUT-R02","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"739d2ce2c6922dc7ce74dfea9ac22d987dd6b8d353484e70c615fc96d2f22074","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-TRACE-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"d7348aca67bf17dc4369a7b8d756b2193571b8c6f7010cc0efb6557ef409da8c","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-OP-TRACES","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"1a7a01affa7bd299c9c0d1652018a5f2e15fa29df034fced669254733da694ad","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R02","ta